run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Offer OGTT in pregnancy</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23688]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Weight</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>: </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Advice regarding diet and exercise</span></span></div>\n<figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"dc7c75a5a66a5439f68aa674\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-11-013\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure dc7c75a5a66a5439f68aa674\" viewbox=\"504825 -66675 228600 276225\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"0459fd359f385493cc51a131a92f087f8b568e5edb7da61b1045df57baac2ffb\"><defs><marker id=\"arrow-end-ad3005ce7e233529d228\" markerwidth=\"10\" markerheight=\"7\" refx=\"9\" refy=\"3.5\" orient=\"auto\" markerunits=\"strokeWidth\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 10 3.5 L 0 7 Z\" fill=\"#000000\"></path></marker></defs><g data-mm-object-id=\"ad3005ce7e233529d228\" transform=\"translate(630767 23495)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0) translate(0 58615.5) rotate(0) scale(1 -1) translate(0 -58615.5)\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 1 117231\" fill=\"none\" fill-opacity=\"0\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"12700\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow-end-ad3005ce7e233529d228)\"></path></g></g></svg></figure>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[23689]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='f